 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 31.94 GiB memory\n\nEDIT: just spent another 8 minutes trying to get it to happen again after reopening the editor and can't get it to reproduce, unfortunately. When it did happen previously, it was easy to cause it to happen again on the same copy of the editor.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2998144871/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2999131914","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107910#issuecomment-2999131914","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107910","id":2999131914,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ywx8K","user":{"login":"DiceWithSpades","id":45715044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NzE1MDQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45715044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiceWithSpades","html_url":"https://github.com/DiceWithSpades","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiceWithSpades/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiceWithSpades/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiceWithSpades/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiceWithSpades/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiceWithSpades/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiceWithSpades/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiceWithSpades/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiceWithSpades/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiceWithSpades/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T07:22:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T07:22:38Z","body":"@Notgoyome editor must be in Script tab for this to happen.\n@precup for me it happens more often, but sometimes randomly works without showing this issue.\n\nMaybe operating system affects the results. I tested what was possible on my side: on macOS it happens very often (noticeable during normal work on a project without trying to invoke it) , Windows 11 from time to time (during normal work it would be much less noticeable than macOS), on Linux (Mint) I was not able to make it happen.\n\nHere is recording from macOS:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/19f84f01-dec2-48e4-9eda-56cc6bbe7a23","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2999131914/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3014200463","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107910#issuecomment-3014200463","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107910","id":3014200463,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zqQyP","user":{"login":"anvilfolk","id":1133892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzM4OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1133892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk","html_url":"https://github.com/anvilfolk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-27T19:46:22Z","updated_at":"2025-06-28T01:16:49Z","body":"Having this happen on my personal project too. Hard to get down to MRP with it sometimes not happening. In my case, it was also occasionally but not always accompanied by\n```\n  ERROR: Cyclic inheritance in script class.\n```\n\nPointing to this part of the code in `modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp`\n\n```cpp\n\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < base_caches.size(); i++) {\n\t\t\tif (base_caches[i] == base_cache.ptr()) {\n\t\t\t\tif (r_err) {\n\t\t\t\t\t*r_err = true;\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\tvalid = false; // to show error in the editor\n\t\t\t\tbase_cache->valid = false;\n\t\t\t\tbase_cache->inheriters_cache.clear(); // to prevent future stackoverflows\n\t\t\t\tbase_cache.unref();\n\t\t\t\tbase.unref();\n\t\t\t\t_base = nullptr;\n\t\t\t\tERR_FAIL_V_MSG(false, \"Cyclic inheritance in script class.\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3014200463/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3605728552","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107910#issuecomment-3605728552","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107910","id":3605728552,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7W6w0o","user":{"login":"TheDying0fLight","id":95179191,"node_id":"U_kgDOBaxRtw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95179191?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDying0fLight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-03T08:51:37Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T21:41:32Z","body":"> Godot v4.6.dev (25203e24c) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8180) - AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 63.11 GiB memory\n\nWhen using the MRP I mostly got a parse error because of old syntax.  But I wanted to note that I also got this error once:\n<img width=\"1279\" height=\"254\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9e23c79b-9c8b-43cf-845c-ef3bfb1f3b07\" />\n\nWhen using the new syntax (`@abstract class_name BaseStuff extends Node`) I don't get any errors. @DiceWithSpades can you reproduce this error in 4.5.1-stable or 4.6.1-stable?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3605728552/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4653101543","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107910#issuecomment-4653101543","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107910","id":4653101543,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFVix5w","user":{